: "V9 Screen 1.png", "id": "33822791454030748", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_33822791507364076_4869218410311609538_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4eCEJ9spcjQQ7kNvwFBKCjg&_nc_oc=AdqebeGO5uPAMlpqnb1JDhN1dnIUoiZ7qHCMbR_K9WWzYxvunEn5h9vIXJW6w0q3re0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQOqyJvz07TMPcjuOIZoFTgHSMPbDenyKaawGGDZzipug&oe=6B0B2432"}, {"file_name": "V9 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1887058972144098", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623565_1887058975477431_2548622667185903053_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hXTIAH8KGKkQ7kNvwHC5Lp2&_nc_oc=Adrgvhen70jdN1Z7zbmoeH8CL8b5dRRufA6aAZwB46VwZAa3N1PmeTnfl1Ayigcu4Uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQDNUI5Bab-QK-ax-lPvB8IzrtQCj0W2M7mADmRBCdZEQ&oe=6B0B20BA"}, {"file_name": "V9 Screen 4.png", "id": "2165697133965690", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_2165697140632356_8122620618765227654_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ePtGwqDfQsQ7kNvwEclu3w&_nc_oc=AdpcsZve18bWs-i1fS0_jRh8MXdHxwt0duGg2h2N_yoHzOS738fF_0RCagpakJWp9qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS7WzJc5AjlYlQkZ8rI7HhuOx3gjXRwBTgH3850UGb6gQ&oe=6B0B2E07"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "test01_fin.png", "id": "885979967249650", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_885979970582983_5973129291003223139_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JTTQWf0f4-IQ7kNvwGJeW4M&_nc_oc=AdpPoTK5tg7dIPhksc-Vp_CqkEepFGFp8EZ6OZ19mf5L9ILZFA0dj0R8zxb8SlXdzPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRGd9TSglAX6ALSAsfHoQwU59wxC2YbHqN0UT9BjaPx6Q&oe=6B0B2E6C"}, "display_name": "Vortex 9", "keywords": ["shooter", "multiplayer", "online", "battle", "pets"], "long_description": "**Vortex 9 is an online shooter with stylish brawlers, insane weapons, explosive shooting battles and cute pets! Supporting cross play with VR, mobile and desktop versions.**\n\nFind yourself in a totally strange and attractive world of fighting cat-people and speaking robots. Is it a demon girl attacking you with a big gun? Who is this guy with a box instead of his head and a bat in his paws? No worries! Get your battle lollipop or a bubble shooting gun and show them who\u2019s the boss! Stylish brawlers, insane weapons, cute pets and explosive shooter battles are here! \n\nVortex 9 main features:\n\n- **Crazy characters!** John, Jane, Marvin McSpy, Mr Goodboy, Jess Purrfect, Hellen D. Mon, Mercydroid and Beelzebox - one is weirder than another. Customize your hero from head to toe!\n- **Crazy weaponry!** Atypical melee weapons, heavy machine guns and bubble blasters will make you the strongest in online multiplayer games!\n- **Cute little helpers in battle!** Create and breed your own pet and let them join a fight!\n- **Various game modes!** Team battle, Deathmatch Solo, Capture point - get a gun and join the battle! More online modes are coming!\n- **Various maps!** Brawl in a variety of beautiful cartoonish locations and enjoy marvelous graphics!\n- **Play with friends using Cross-play!** Make fights more fun and intense together! VR players can join the same matches, use the same weapons and pets, and experience Vortex 9 in a fully immersive way while remaining part of the unified ecosystem.", "short_description": "Vortex 9 is an online shooter with stylish brawlers, insane weapons, explosive shooting battles and cute pets! Supporting cross play with VR, mobile and desktop versions. Find yourself in a totally strange and attractive world of fighting cat-people and speaking robots. Get your battle lollipop, charge a bubble shooting gun, team up with your hog and show them who\u2019s the boss!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pri